      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791213592570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Service\n    - some code that \"owns\" some data and all the process related to that data.\n    - Owning data means that it isn't a good idea to have services share database tables.\n    \n\n\"Independently Deployable\"\n    - \"Distributed Monolith\"\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Service\n    - some code that \"owns\" some data and all the process related to that data.\n    - Owning data means that it isn't a good idea to have services share database tables.\n    \n\n\"Independently Deployable\"\n    - \"Distributed Monolith\"\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dLtY9EKp9_kIi53j2bkgw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 279,
      "y": 337,
      "width": 582.8396606445312,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
